      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Smithsburg%2C_Maryland",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A cannon ball from that 1863 duel remains lodged in a Water Street building wall.",
